Use atomic_cmpxchg(&pending, 0, 1) in rk_worker_request(). Check the action
switch before that operation, then wake the wait queue only after the slot is
full. The timer records its firing, calls this same function, ignores its
result, and rearms itself.

The worker waits for pending or stop. Check stop first, clear the slot with
atomic_xchg(&pending, 0), then check the action switch again before recording a
run.

Start state, worker, procfs, then timer. Stop procfs, timer, worker, then state.
